sentences.text:
Having regard to the facts and circumstances of the case, it is hereby ordered that out of total compensation amount, the amount is disbursed as follows :
(a) Petitioner No.1/Sh. Tara Chand (father of deceased) shall be entitled to share amount of Rs.20,00,000/- (Rupees Twenty Lacs Only) alongwith proportionate interest;
(b) Petitioner No.2/Sh. Sourabh Chand (brother of deceased) shall be entitled to share amount of Rs.19,41,101/- (Rupees Nineteen Lacs Forty One Thousand One Hundred One Only) alongwith proportionate interest;
41.

